<title>HONG KONG: Liu Chong Hing Bank H1 net up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Liu Chong Hing Bank H1 net up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   68.0	vs 56.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    18.0	vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3.09 gain vs 23.47 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    270.18    vs 224.98</p>
<p>    Company name		 Liu Chong Hing Bank Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 23-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Liu Chong Hing Bank, 53.68 percent owned by Liu Chong Hing Investment Ltd, provides banking, financial and related services to commercial, industrial and individual customers.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of investments.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
